+#[test]
+fn the_typed_kinds_and_face_off_the_stock_into_the_part_gouge_and_never_post() {
+    // Slot, Trochoidal slot and Circular inside the part's pocket, 3 mm
+    // under its floor; a Face down to Z 5, 3 mm into the part's top.
